{"4670350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hookeye", "steam_appid": 4670350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>IT'S THE END OF THE LINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck to a foggy dock off the California coast, this fisherman is left with nothing but a couple of beers, his dwindling fishing gear, and an all-consuming obsession. He is sacrificing all he is for the sake of what he loves. But to what end? What purpose? The legendary siren, of course. It has to be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR EXECUTION</strong> <br>All fish serve to get you a bigger fish. You just have to make the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>SCRAP FOR RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have limited bait and hooks. When things run dry, you'll have to improvise.  <br><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR</strong><br>Follow the fisherman as his senses begin to deceive him. Stay focused on the prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST KEEP FISHING</strong><br> There's nothing left to do but to keep fishing. Resist the madness, so you can fish more. <br> <br><strong>A RELENTLESS STORY</strong> <br>Piece together your past by discovering artifacts. <br> <br><strong>CATCH THE SIREN</strong> <br>That siren will make this all worth it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>IT'S THE END OF THE LINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck to a foggy dock off the California coast, this fisherman is left with nothing but a couple of beers, his dwindling fishing gear, and an all-consuming obsession. He is sacrificing all he is for the sake of what he loves. But to what end? What purpose? The legendary siren, of course. It has to be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR EXECUTION</strong> <br>All fish serve to get you a bigger fish. You just have to make the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>SCRAP FOR RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have limited bait and hooks. When things run dry, you'll have to improvise.  <br><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR</strong><br>Follow the fisherman as his senses begin to deceive him. Stay focused on the prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST KEEP FISHING</strong><br> There's nothing left to do but to keep fishing. Resist the madness, so you can fish more. <br> <br><strong>A RELENTLESS STORY</strong> <br>Piece together your past by discovering artifacts. <br> <br><strong>CATCH THE SIREN</strong> <br>That siren will make this all worth it.</p>", "short_description": "Hookeye is a first-person horror fishing game where YOU become the bait. To balance your scarce resources in a relentless cycle of desperation, you sacrifice everything for the next big catch.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670350/2420d827ebe50bd5a38b3ee274d08aed4233fbc6/header.jpg?t=1788248909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670350/a482e4545186af87c9aab4504c7b5603bcc5540a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788248909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670350/a482e4545186af87c9aab4504c7b5603bcc5540a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788248909", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><